    {
      "subId": "2070010",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207003101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207003101": {
            "id": "207003101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll head for the mountainside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003102"
            ]
          },
          "207003102": {
            "id": "207003102",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Ah, there's some cargo of mine that I had intended to transport back and sell on the mountainside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003103"
            ]
          },
          "207003103": {
            "id": "207003103",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "But now, not only have the roads been blocked, but the area where I stored my cargo has also been occupied by hilichurls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003104"
            ]
          },
          "207003104": {
            "id": "207003104",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Fortunately, they don't have a good eye for value, and didn't touch my goods.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003105"
            ]
          },
          "207003105": {
            "id": "207003105",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Now go and clear them out, and remember not to touch my cargo. Those boxes break easily.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003106"
            ]
          },
          "207003106": {
            "id": "207003106",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "*sigh* With these roads being blocked, those goods probably can't be sold anymore..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070011",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207004101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207004101": {
            "id": "207004101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll go for the mountaintop.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004102"
            ]
          },
          "207004102": {
            "id": "207004102",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "The group of hilichurls on the mountaintop are the hardest to deal with. I used to go there to relax, but now I dare not even venture close. Very unfortunate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004103"
            ]
          },
          "207004103": {
            "id": "207004103",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Well, you look quite capable, so I suppose it'll be a fitting task for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004104"
            ]
          },
          "207004104": {
            "id": "207004104",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Remember, that big blockhead with the axe has to go first. Watching him walk around all full of himself just makes my blood boil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004105"
            ]
          },
          "207004105": {
            "id": "207004105",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Then there's the one that waves its big shield around in your face. What an eyesore...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004106"
            ]
          },
          "207004106": {
            "id": "207004106",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Finally, you want to take out those with the long staves... What do they call them, again? Samachurls? Either way, they don't look so tough...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004107"
            ]
          },
          "207004107": {
            "id": "207004107",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "In any case, get rid of them all. Get them out of my sight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070013",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207003201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207003201": {
            "id": "207003201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003202"
            ]
          },
          "207003202": {
            "id": "207003202",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Not bad, not bad. Not a box was damaged, either — you know what you're doing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003203"
            ]
          },
          "207003203": {
            "id": "207003203",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Here, take this 5,000 Mora. If the opportunity comes, let us do business again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003204"
            ]
          },
          "207003204": {
            "id": "207003204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "All that work, just for 5,000 Mora...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003205"
            ]
          },
          "207003205": {
            "id": "207003205",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Don't you get picky, now. I calculated this remuneration very carefully, and it is commensurate with the work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207003206"
            ]
          },
          "207003206": {
            "id": "207003206",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "One must do great things to earn great rewards. If we have the chance to meet again, you can try your luck then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070014",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207004201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207004201": {
            "id": "207004201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That's a wrap.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004202"
            ]
          },
          "207004202": {
            "id": "207004202",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Not... Not bad at all, you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004203"
            ]
          },
          "207004203": {
            "id": "207004203",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Forget it, I'll say nothing more. Take this 5,000 Mora. We Snezhnayan merchants always deliver as promised.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004204"
            ]
          },
          "207004204": {
            "id": "207004204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So Snezhnayan merchants only deliver 5,000 Mora, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004205"
            ]
          },
          "207004205": {
            "id": "207004205",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Don't you get picky, now. I calculated this remuneration very carefully, and it is commensurate with the work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004206"
            ]
          },
          "207004206": {
            "id": "207004206",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "One must do great things to earn great rewards. If we have the chance to meet again, you can try your luck then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2070015",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "207004301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "207004301": {
            "id": "207004301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004302"
            ]
          },
          "207004302": {
            "id": "207004302",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "...I watched you work from the side, you know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004303"
            ]
          },
          "207004303": {
            "id": "207004303",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "But are you just used to doing things at your own pace, or did you not pay any heed to the order I gave you at all?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004304"
            ]
          },
          "207004304": {
            "id": "207004304",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Do you know? In Snezhnaya, we say that we \"deliver as promised.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004305"
            ]
          },
          "207004305": {
            "id": "207004305",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "I pay you to do things for me, and every word that I say has meaning.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004306"
            ]
          },
          "207004306": {
            "id": "207004306",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "You did complete the task, but these results... I can only give you 1,000 Mora at most. Take it and go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004307"
            ]
          },
          "207004307": {
            "id": "207004307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What? 1,000 Mora? What can we even use that for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "207004308"
            ]
          },
          "207004308": {
            "id": "207004308",
            "speakerId": 1654,
            "speakerName": "Tsarevich",
            "text": "Hmph. Too little, you say? You didn't even do the job right. This 1,000 Mora is more than sufficient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
